### 获取所有课件
GET http://localhost:3000/api/teacher/lessons

### 获取单个课件
GET http://localhost:3000/api/teacher/lessons/1

### 获取所有任务
GET http://localhost:3000/api/teacher/tasks

### 获取课件的任务
GET http://localhost:3000/api/teacher/tasks/lesson/1

### 获取所有提交
GET http://localhost:3000/api/teacher/submissions

### 获取未批改的提交
GET http://localhost:3000/api/teacher/submissions/ungraded

### 获取统计信息
GET http://localhost:3000/api/teacher/stats

### 获取所有学生
GET http://localhost:3000/api/teacher/students

### 学生加入课堂
POST http://localhost:3000/api/student/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "测试学生",
  "studentNumber": "STU001",
  "deviceId": "device_123",
  "socketId": "socket_456"
}

### 学生获取当前课件
GET http://localhost:3000/api/student/lesson/current

### 学生获取任务
GET http://localhost:3000/api/student/tasks

### 学生提交作业
POST http://localhost:3000/api/student/submit
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="taskId"

1
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="studentId"

1
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="answer"

这是学生的答案
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### 获取学生提交记录
GET http://localhost:3000/api/student/my-submissions/1

### 获取学生统计
GET http://localhost:3000/api/student/my-stats/1

### 批改作业
POST http://localhost:3000/api/teacher/grade/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "teacherFeedback": "批改评语"
}

### 获取阿里云配置状态
GET http://localhost:3000/api/config/alicloud/status

### 获取Qwen配置状态
GET http://localhost:3000/api/config/qwen/status

### 获取备份配置状态
GET http://localhost:3000/api/config/backup/status